<?xml version="1.0"?><iai friendlyname="Learning architecture" id="0016f34c" height="400" width="556" hasaudio="0" hascredits="0" lang="E" basecontroltype="DragDrop" outlinecolorid="1" skinstyle="Standard" skinlib="standard"><slides><slide type="dragdrop" sequence="1" slideid="1"><standardslide><toptext textstyleid="1"><text>&lt;html&gt;Construye estos edificios arrastrando las piezas a su lugar correspondiente.&lt;/html&gt;</text></toptext><image>0016f34c_staging.swf</image><bgimage>DDGv_standard_bg.swf</bgimage><imagerefid/><items><item id="0" seq="1" zindex="4" sequence="1"><image inbucketwidth="67" inbucketheight="111" onstagewidth="134" onstageheight="223" popwidth="67" popheight="111" onstagex="43" onstagey="80" baseheight="223" basewidth="134" pctstage="100" pctpop="50" pctbucket="50">torres_goth.swf</image><hotarea><point><x>43</x><y>81</y></point><point><x>41</x><y>304</y></point><point><x>179</x><y>304</y></point><point><x>178</x><y>78</y></point><point><x>43</x><y>81</y></point></hotarea><tooltext>Torres</tooltext><solvedtooltext>A ambos lados de la fachada se levantan dos altas torres en las que se abren numerosas ventanas.</solvedtooltext><imagerefid/><altitems/></item><item id="1" seq="1" zindex="11" sequence="2"><image inbucketwidth="27" inbucketheight="30" onstagewidth="36" onstageheight="41" popwidth="27" popheight="30" onstagex="286" onstagey="263" baseheight="41" basewidth="36" pctstage="100" pctpop="75" pctbucket="75">portado_rom.swf</image><hotarea><point><x>281</x><y>261</y></point><point><x>281</x><y>304</y></point><point><x>326</x><y>302</y></point><point><x>326</x><y>262</y></point><point><x>281</x><y>261</y></point></hotarea><tooltext>Portada</tooltext><solvedtooltext>En la portada o entrada de las iglesias románicas se utiliza el arco de medio punto, con forma de media circunferencia.</solvedtooltext><imagerefid/><altitems/></item><item id="2" seq="1" zindex="7" sequence="3"><image inbucketwidth="27" inbucketheight="26" onstagewidth="35" onstageheight="34" popwidth="27" popheight="26" onstagex="92" onstagey="201" baseheight="35" basewidth="36" pctstage="99.9" pctpop="75" pctbucket="75">roseton_goth.swf</image><hotarea><point><x>86</x><y>196</y></point><point><x>86</x><y>234</y></point><point><x>129</x><y>236</y></point><point><x>127</x><y>198</y></point><point><x>86</x><y>196</y></point></hotarea><tooltext>Rosetón</tooltext><solvedtooltext>Sobre la entrada se abre una gran ventana circular, cubierta por cristales de colores, llamada rosetón.</solvedtooltext><imagerefid/><altitems/></item><item id="3" seq="1" zindex="8" sequence="4"><image inbucketwidth="44" inbucketheight="45" onstagewidth="51" onstageheight="53" popwidth="44" popheight="45" onstagex="278" onstagey="250" baseheight="54" basewidth="52" pctstage="98.3" pctpop="85" pctbucket="85">contrafuertes_rom.swf</image><hotarea><point><x>278</x><y>250</y></point><point><x>275</x><y>304</y></point><point><x>339</x><y>305</y></point><point><x>337</x><y>246</y></point><point><x>278</x><y>250</y></point></hotarea><tooltext>Contrafuertes</tooltext><solvedtooltext>Para reforzar los muros se usaban contrafuertes, que eran pilares adosados al exterior de las paredes.</solvedtooltext><imagerefid/><altitems/></item><item id="4" seq="1" zindex="6" sequence="5"><image inbucketwidth="43" inbucketheight="31" onstagewidth="43" onstageheight="31" popwidth="43" popheight="31" onstagex="89" onstagey="239" baseheight="31" basewidth="43" pctstage="100" pctpop="100" pctbucket="100">vidrieras_goth.swf</image><hotarea><point><x>88</x><y>234</y></point><point><x>87</x><y>272</y></point><point><x>134</x><y>271</y></point><point><x>133</x><y>234</y></point><point><x>88</x><y>234</y></point></hotarea><tooltext>Vidrieras</tooltext><solvedtooltext>Los muros de las catedrales góticas son más finos. Por ese motivo se podían abrir grandes ventanales que se cubrían con vidrieras de colores.</solvedtooltext><imagerefid/><altitems/></item><item id="5" seq="1" zindex="12" sequence="6"><image inbucketwidth="97" inbucketheight="81" onstagewidth="140" onstageheight="116" popwidth="97" popheight="81" onstagex="234" onstagey="187" baseheight="116" basewidth="139" pctstage="100.8" pctpop="70" pctbucket="70">torres_rom.swf</image><hotarea><point><x>233</x><y>182</y></point><point><x>233</x><y>308</y></point><point><x>376</x><y>307</y></point><point><x>375</x><y>183</y></point><point><x>233</x><y>182</y></point></hotarea><tooltext>Torres</tooltext><solvedtooltext>A ambos lados de la fachada se construían dos torres con muy pocas ventanas, como los castillos.</solvedtooltext><imagerefid/><altitems/></item><item id="6" seq="1" zindex="9" sequence="7"><image inbucketwidth="90" inbucketheight="48" onstagewidth="120" onstageheight="64" popwidth="90" popheight="48" onstagex="50" onstagey="92" baseheight="64" basewidth="120" pctstage="100" pctpop="75" pctbucket="75">pinaculas_goth.swf</image><hotarea><point><x>39</x><y>89</y></point><point><x>45</x><y>172</y></point><point><x>172</x><y>165</y></point><point><x>172</x><y>86</y></point><point><x>39</x><y>89</y></point></hotarea><tooltext>Pináculos</tooltext><solvedtooltext>Las iglesias góticas están mucho más decoradas que las románicas. Un ejemplo son estas pequeñas torrecillas llamadas pináculos.</solvedtooltext><imagerefid/><altitems/></item><item id="7" seq="1" zindex="3" sequence="8"><image inbucketwidth="24" inbucketheight="26" onstagewidth="27" onstageheight="29" popwidth="24" popheight="26" onstagex="97" onstagey="155" baseheight="26" basewidth="24" pctstage="115" pctpop="100" pctbucket="100">gablete_goth.swf</image><hotarea><point><x>92</x><y>153</y></point><point><x>92</x><y>185</y></point><point><x>125</x><y>185</y></point><point><x>125</x><y>153</y></point><point><x>92</x><y>153</y></point></hotarea><tooltext>Gablete</tooltext><solvedtooltext>En lo alto de la fachada, algunas veces se construía un triángulo llamado gablete. Su única función es decorativa.</solvedtooltext><imagerefid/><altitems/></item><item id="9" seq="1" zindex="2" sequence="9"><image inbucketwidth="80" inbucketheight="56" onstagewidth="101" onstageheight="70" popwidth="80" popheight="56" onstagex="59" onstagey="16" baseheight="70" basewidth="101" pctstage="100.7" pctpop="80" pctbucket="80">agujas_goth.swf</image><hotarea><point><x>56</x><y>15</y></point><point><x>57</x><y>93</y></point><point><x>167</x><y>92</y></point><point><x>164</x><y>12</y></point><point><x>56</x><y>15</y></point></hotarea><tooltext>Agujas</tooltext><solvedtooltext>En lo alto de las torres se construían unas esbeltas agujas de piedra para dar sensación de más altura.</solvedtooltext><imagerefid/><altitems/></item><item id="8" seq="1" zindex="10" sequence="10"><image inbucketwidth="48" inbucketheight="28" onstagewidth="48" onstageheight="28" popwidth="48" popheight="28" onstagex="87" onstagey="271" baseheight="28" basewidth="48" pctstage="100" pctpop="100" pctbucket="100">portado_goth.swf</image><hotarea><point><x>83</x><y>269</y></point><point><x>83</x><y>307</y></point><point><x>134</x><y>305</y></point><point><x>136</x><y>270</y></point><point><x>83</x><y>269</y></point></hotarea><tooltext>Portada</tooltext><solvedtooltext>En la portada o entrada de las catedrales góticas se empezó a utilizar el arco apuntado, con forma de lanza.</solvedtooltext><imagerefid/><altitems/></item><item id="10" seq="1" zindex="1" sequence="11"><image inbucketwidth="69" inbucketheight="63" onstagewidth="92" onstageheight="85" popwidth="69" popheight="63" onstagex="257" onstagey="218" baseheight="85" basewidth="92" pctstage="100" pctpop="75" pctbucket="75">facada_rom.swf</image><hotarea><point><x>256</x><y>217</y></point><point><x>257</x><y>308</y></point><point><x>352</x><y>306</y></point><point><x>351</x><y>218</y></point><point><x>256</x><y>217</y></point></hotarea><tooltext>Fachada</tooltext><solvedtooltext>Los muros de las iglesias románicas eran muy anchos y apenas tenían ventanas.</solvedtooltext><imagerefid/><altitems/></item><item id="11" seq="1" zindex="5" sequence="12"><image inbucketwidth="37" inbucketheight="90" onstagewidth="50" onstageheight="121" popwidth="37" popheight="90" onstagex="85" onstagey="182" baseheight="120" basewidth="50" pctstage="100.9" pctpop="75" pctbucket="75">facada_goth.swf</image><hotarea><point><x>86</x><y>179</y></point><point><x>85</x><y>304</y></point><point><x>138</x><y>302</y></point><point><x>138</x><y>179</y></point><point><x>86</x><y>179</y></point></hotarea><tooltext>Fachada</tooltext><solvedtooltext>Las fachadas góticas se dividen, por lo general, en tres pisos y están cubiertas de grandes ventanales.</solvedtooltext><imagerefid/><altitems/></item></items><bgimagerefid/><rewards><reward><text textstyleid="2">&lt;html&gt;¡Enhorabuena, excelente puntuación!&lt;/html&gt;</text><imagefile>baserew1.swf</imagefile></reward><reward><text textstyleid="2">&lt;html&gt;Lo has hecho muy bien. ¿Quieres jugar de nuevo?&lt;/html&gt;</text><imagefile>baserew2.swf</imagefile></reward><reward><text textstyleid="2">&lt;html&gt;Seguro que puedes hacerlo mejor. ¿Quieres intentarlo de nuevo?&lt;/html&gt;</text><imagefile>baserew3.swf</imagefile></reward></rewards></standardslide></slide></slides><iaigame bucketdirection="vertical" bucketposx="0" bucketposy="36" stagewidth="414" stageheight="330" bucketwidth="126" bucketheight="330"><resetbuttontext textbuttonstyleid="1">&lt;html&gt;Nuevo intento&lt;/html&gt;</resetbuttontext><scorelabeltext textstyleid="3">&lt;html&gt;Puntuación:&lt;/html&gt;</scorelabeltext><matcheslabeltext textstyleid="4">&lt;html&gt;aciertos&lt;/html&gt;</matcheslabeltext><trieslabeltext textstyleid="4">&lt;html&gt;intentos&lt;/html&gt;</trieslabeltext></iaigame><textstyles><textstyle size="16" font="Trebuchet MS" bold="1" italic="0" underline="0" colorid="2" align="left" id="1"/><textstyle size="20" font="Trebuchet MS" bold="1" italic="0" underline="0" colorid="2" align="center" id="2"/><textstyle size="16" font="Trebuchet MS" bold="1" italic="1" underline="0" colorid="1" align="left" id="3"/><textstyle size="12" font="Trebuchet MS" bold="1" italic="1" underline="0" colorid="1" align="left" id="4"/><textstyle size="13" font="Trebuchet MS" bold="1" italic="0" underline="0" colorid="3" align="center" id="5"/><textstyle size="13" font="Trebuchet MS" bold="1" italic="0" underline="0" colorid="4" align="center" id="6"/><textstyle size="20" font="Trebuchet MS" bold="0" italic="0" underline="0" colorid="5" align="left" id="7"/><textstyle size="11" font="Trebuchet MS" bold="0" italic="0" underline="0" colorid="5" align="left" id="8"/></textstyles><textbuttonstyles><textbuttonstyle showbg="0" showoutline="0" basestyleid="5" rollstyleid="5" downstyleid="5" selectedstyleid="5" disabledstyleid="6" basestateid="1" rollstateid="1" downstateid="1" selectedstateid="1" disabledstateid="2" id="1"/></textbuttonstyles><creditsdialogdata bodystyleid="8" titlestyleid="7"><dialogtitle>&lt;html&gt;Créditos&lt;/html&gt;</dialogtitle><text/></creditsdialogdata><colors><color r="137" g="51" b="204" id="1"/><color r="50" g="50" b="50" id="2"/><color r="255" g="255" b="255" id="3"/><color r="228" g="194" b="255" id="4"/><color r="0" g="0" b="0" id="5"/></colors><twocolorbuttonstates><tcbuttonstate outlinecolorid="3" bgcolorid="3" graphiccolorid="3" id="1"/><tcbuttonstate outlinecolorid="3" bgcolorid="3" graphiccolorid="4" id="2"/></twocolorbuttonstates><twocolorbuttonstyles/></iai>